#13_Period_and_Comma
I am here. You are there. We sit, we type, we learn. The sun is up. The day is long. Tom, Sue, and Ray went home. Apples, pears, and plums are fruit. Yes, I can. No, I will not. First, sit up straight. Next, place your hands. Then, type slowly. Finally, check your work.

