#20_Lets_Try_Sentences
The cat sat on the mat. I like to read books. The sun rises in the east. We play in the park after school. My father works in the city. She drinks a glass of water every morning. The dog runs fast in the garden. Birds sing early in the morning. We eat dinner together every night.

#21_Simple_Paragraph
Tom has a small garden behind his house. Every morning he waters the flowers and pulls out the weeds. In spring the garden is full of red and yellow flowers. Tom's neighbor often stops by to say hello. Sometimes Tom gives her a bunch of fresh flowers. They both enjoy the sweet smell and the warm sun.

#22_Everyday_Conversation
"Good morning, Anna! How are you today?" "I'm fine, thank you. And you?" "I'm great. Are you going to school?" "Yes, the bus leaves at 8:15. Would you like to join me?" "That sounds nice. Let me get my bag." "Don't forget your lunch!" "Thanks for reminding me. I'll be right back."

#23_Short_Story
Once there was a little boat that wanted to see the sea. Every day it floated on a quiet river and watched the big ships sail by. One morning the river grew wide, and the boat drifted far from home. At last it reached the sea. The water sparkled, the wind was gentle, and the little boat was very happy.

